---

<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
		<title>CICON Hackathon 2025 - Build the Future of Repair</title>
		<meta name="description" content="Join CICON Hackathon 2025 - A one-day hackathon focused on building innovative solutions for the repair ecosystem. September 6, 2025." />
		<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
		<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
		<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
	</head>
	<body>
		<nav class="nav">
			<div class="nav-container">
				<div class="nav-brand">
					<img src="/cicon_logo.svg" alt="CICON" class="logo" />
					<span class="nav-title">CICON Hackathon 2025</span>
				</div>
				<div class="nav-links">
					<a href="#timeline">Timeline</a>
					<a href="#themes">Challenges</a>
					<a href="#prizes">Prizes</a>
					<a href="#register" class="btn-primary">Register Now</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</nav>

		<main>
			<!-- Hero Section -->
			<section class="hero">
				<div class="container">
					<div class="hero-content">
						<div class="hero-badge">
							<span>September 6, 2025 • 9 AM - 6 PM GMT+7</span>
						</div>
						<h1 class="hero-title">
							Build the Future of <span class="gradient-text">Repair</span>
						</h1>
						<p class="hero-description">
							Join CICON Hackathon 2025 and create innovative solutions that empower repair communities, 
							streamline logistics, and promote sustainable practices. One day. Three challenges. Endless possibilities.
						</p>
						<div class="hero-actions">
							<a href="#register" class="btn-primary btn-large">
								Register for Free
							</a>
							<a href="#timeline" class="btn-secondary btn-large">
								View Timeline
							</a>
						</div>
						<div class="hero-stats">
							<div class="stat">
								<div class="stat-number">£250</div>
								<div class="stat-label">Total Prizes</div>
							</div>
							<div class="stat">
								<div class="stat-number">3</div>
								<div class="stat-label">Challenge Themes</div>
							</div>
							<div class="stat">
								<div class="stat-number">10</div>
								<div class="stat-label">Finalist Teams</div>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- Timeline Section -->
			<section id="timeline" class="timeline-section">
				<div class="container">
					<h2 class="section-title">Hackathon Timeline</h2>
					<p class="section-description">From registration to winner announcement - here's how it all unfolds</p>
					
					<div class="timeline">
						<div class="timeline-item">
							<div class="timeline-date">July 16 - August 25</div>
							<div class="timeline-content">
								<h3>Registration & Idea Submission</h3>
								<p>Teams sign up and submit a short idea with problem statement and proposed approach</p>
							</div>
						</div>
						
						<div class="timeline-item">
							<div class="timeline-date">August 26 - 28</div>
							<div class="timeline-content">
								<h3>Review & Shortlisting</h3>
								<p>Internal team selects the top ten teams for the live hackathon</p>
							</div>
						</div>
						
						<div class="timeline-item">
							<div class="timeline-date">August 29</div>
							<div class="timeline-content">
								<h3>Finalist Announcement</h3>
								<p>Selected teams announced with preparation materials and mentor assignments</p>
							</div>
						</div>
						
						<div class="timeline-item">
							<div class="timeline-date">August 30 - September 5</div>
							<div class="timeline-content">
								<h3>Mentor Check-in</h3>
								<p>One-on-one mentor sessions to help finalists refine scope and prepare</p>
							</div>
						</div>
						
						<div class="timeline-item highlight">
							<div class="timeline-date">September 6</div>
							<div class="timeline-content">
								<h3>Live Hackathon Day</h3>
								<p>One-day hackathon (9 AM - 6 PM GMT+7) with mentor sessions and checkpoints</p>
							</div>
						</div>
						
						<div class="timeline-item">
							<div class="timeline-date">September 6/7</div>
							<div class="timeline-content">
								<h3>Pitching & Winner Announcement</h3>
								<p>Live pitch presentations, Q&A sessions, and winner announcement</p>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- Themes Section -->
			<section id="themes" class="themes-section">
				<div class="container">
					<h2 class="section-title">Challenge Themes</h2>
					<p class="section-description">Choose your focus area and build solutions that bring value to CICON</p>
					
					<div class="themes-grid">
						<div class="theme-card">
							<div class="theme-icon">🌐</div>
							<h3>Community Amplification</h3>
							<p class="theme-subtitle">Grow and empower repair networks</p>
							<p>Build a platform that helps CICON discover, onboard, and manage a distributed network of neighbourhood cobblers and tailors for predictable turnaround times across the UK.</p>
							<div class="theme-features">
								<span class="feature-tag">Self-serve onboarding</span>
								<span class="feature-tag">Live capacity tracking</span>
								<span class="feature-tag">Smart job assignment</span>
							</div>
						</div>
						
						<div class="theme-card">
							<div class="theme-icon">📦</div>
							<h3>Barrier Free Logistics</h3>
							<p class="theme-subtitle">Simplify shipping for micro businesses</p>
							<p>Create a workflow that generates courier labels for micro repair businesses, even when big shipping aggregators hide their APIs, making logistics accessible to all.</p>
							<div class="theme-features">
								<span class="feature-tag">API-less integration</span>
								<span class="feature-tag">Automated workflows</span>
								<span class="feature-tag">Cost optimization</span>
							</div>
						</div>
						
						<div class="theme-card">
							<div class="theme-icon">📱</div>
							<h3>Culture of Repair</h3>
							<p class="theme-subtitle">Make repair visible and aspirational</p>
							<p>Build a social proof engine that transforms raw before-and-after content into branded, shareable assets that showcase the power of repair and drive viral growth.</p>
							<div class="theme-features">
								<span class="feature-tag">Content automation</span>
								<span class="feature-tag">Brand consistency</span>
								<span class="feature-tag">Social sharing</span>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- Prizes Section -->
			<section id="prizes" class="prizes-section">
				<div class="container">
					<h2 class="section-title">Prizes & Recognition</h2>
					<p class="section-description">Winning entries bring the greatest value to CICON</p>
					
					<div class="prizes-grid">
						<div class="prize-card winner">
							<div class="prize-badge">1st Place</div>
							<div class="prize-amount">£200</div>
							<div class="prize-title">Implementation & Cash Prize</div>
							<p>Your solution gets implemented into CICON's platform plus cash reward</p>
							<div class="prize-features">
								<div class="prize-feature">✓ Full implementation</div>
								<div class="prize-feature">✓ £200 cash prize</div>
								<div class="prize-feature">✓ CICON partnership opportunity</div>
							</div>
						</div>
						
						<div class="prize-card runner-up">
							<div class="prize-badge">2nd Place</div>
							<div class="prize-amount">£50</div>
							<div class="prize-title">Pilot with CICON</div>
							<p>Run a pilot program with CICON with up to £50 budget</p>
							<div class="prize-features">
								<div class="prize-feature">✓ Pilot implementation</div>
								<div class="prize-feature">✓ £50 budget</div>
								<div class="prize-feature">✓ Mentorship opportunity</div>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- Registration Section -->
			<section id="register" class="register-section">
				<div class="container">
					<div class="register-content">
						<h2>Ready to Build the Future?</h2>
						<p>Registration opens soon. Be the first to know when applications go live.</p>
						<div class="register-form">
							<input type="email" placeholder="Enter your email address" class="email-input" />
							<button class="btn-primary">Notify Me</button>
						</div>
						<p class="register-note">
							Registration period: July 16 - August 25, 2025<br/>
							Teams can submit via Devpost or Google Form
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- Footer -->
			<footer class="footer">
				<div class="container">
					<div class="footer-content">
						<div class="footer-brand">
							<img src="/cicon_logo.svg" alt="CICON" class="footer-logo" />
							<p>Building the future of repair, one solution at a time.</p>
						</div>
						<div class="footer-links">
							<h4>Quick Links</h4>
							<a href="#timeline">Timeline</a>
							<a href="#themes">Challenges</a>
							<a href="#prizes">Prizes</a>
							<a href="#register">Register</a>
						</div>
						<div class="footer-contact">
							<h4>Connect</h4>
							<p>Discord server coming soon</p>
							<p>Follow updates on social media</p>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="footer-bottom">
						<p>&copy; 2025 CICON. All rights reserved.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</footer>
		</main>

		<style>
			* {
				margin: 0;
				padding: 0;
				box-sizing: border-box;
			}

			body {
				font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
				line-height: 1.6;
				color: #1a1a1a;
				background: #ffffff;
			}

			.container {
				max-width: 1200px;
				margin: 0 auto;
				padding: 0 2rem;
			}

			/* Navigation */
			.nav {
				position: fixed;
				top: 0;
				left: 0;
				right: 0;
				background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
				backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
				border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
				z-index: 1000;
			}

			.nav-container {
				max-width: 1200px;
				margin: 0 auto;
				padding: 1rem 2rem;
				display: flex;
				align-items: center;
				justify-content: space-between;
			}

			.nav-brand {
				display: flex;
				align-items: center;
				gap: 0.75rem;
			}

			.logo {
				height: 32px;
				width: auto;
			}

			.nav-title {
				font-weight: 600;
				font-size: 1.1rem;
			}

			.nav-links {
				display: flex;
				align-items: center;
				gap: 2rem;
			}

			.nav-links a {
				text-decoration: none;
				color: #666;
				font-weight: 500;
				transition: color 0.2s;
			}

			.nav-links a:hover {
				color: #197F59;
			}

			/* Buttons */
			.btn-primary {
				background: #197F59;
				color: white;
				padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
				border-radius: 8px;
				text-decoration: none;
				font-weight: 500;
				transition: all 0.2s;
				border: none;
				cursor: pointer;
				display: inline-flex;
				align-items: center;
				justify-content: center;
			}

			.btn-primary:hover {
				background: #0D402D;
				transform: translateY(-1px);
			}

			.btn-secondary {
				background: transparent;
				color: #197F59;
				padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
				border: 2px solid #197F59;
				border-radius: 8px;
				text-decoration: none;
				font-weight: 500;
				transition: all 0.2s;
			}

			.btn-secondary:hover {
				background: #197F59;
				color: white;
			}

			.btn-large {
				padding: 1rem 2rem;
				font-size: 1.1rem;
			}

			/* Hero Section */
			.hero {
				padding: 8rem 0 6rem;
				background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f8fafc 0%, #e2e8f0 100%);
			}

			.hero-content {
				text-align: center;
				max-width: 800px;
				margin: 0 auto;
			}

			.hero-badge {
				display: inline-block;
				background: #d1fae5;
				color: #197F59;
				padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
				border-radius: 50px;
				font-size: 0.9rem;
				font-weight: 500;
				margin-bottom: 2rem;
			}

			.hero-title {
				font-size: 3.5rem;
				font-weight: 700;
				margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
				line-height: 1.1;
			}

			.gradient-text {
				background: linear-gradient(135deg, #197F59, #0D402D);
				-webkit-background-clip: text;
				-webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
				background-clip: text;
			}

			.hero-description {
				font-size: 1.25rem;
				color: #64748b;
				margin-bottom: 3rem;
				line-height: 1.6;
			}

			.hero-actions {
				display: flex;
				gap: 1rem;
				justify-content: center;
				margin-bottom: 4rem;
			}

			.hero-stats {
				display: flex;
				justify-content: center;
				gap: 4rem;
			}

			.stat {
				text-align: center;
			}

			.stat-number {
				font-size: 2rem;
				font-weight: 700;
				color: #197F59;
			}

			.stat-label {
				color: #64748b;
				font-size: 0.9rem;
			}

			/* Section Styles */
			.section-title {
				font-size: 2.5rem;
				font-weight: 700;
				text-align: center;
				margin-bottom: 1rem;
			}

			.section-description {
				font-size: 1.2rem;
				color: #64748b;
				text-align: center;
				margin-bottom: 4rem;
			}

			/* Timeline Section */
			.timeline-section {
				padding: 6rem 0;
				background: white;
			}

			.timeline {
				max-width: 800px;
				margin: 0 auto;
			}

			.timeline-item {
				display: flex;
				gap: 2rem;
				margin-bottom: 3rem;
				padding: 2rem;
				border-radius: 12px;
				border: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
				transition: all 0.2s;
			}

			.timeline-item:hover {
				border-color: #197F59;
				transform: translateY(-2px);
				box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(25, 127, 89, 0.1);
			}

			.timeline-item.highlight {
				background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d1fae5, #ecfdf5);
				border-color: #197F59;
			}

			.timeline-date {
				min-width: 200px;
				font-weight: 600;
				color: #197F59;
				font-size: 0.9rem;
			}

			.timeline-content h3 {
				font-size: 1.3rem;
				font-weight: 600;
				margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
			}

			.timeline-content p {
				color: #64748b;
			}

			/* Themes Section */
			.themes-section {
				padding: 6rem 0;
				background: #f8fafc;
			}

			.themes-grid {
				display: grid;
				grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(350px, 1fr));
				gap: 2rem;
			}

			.theme-card {
				background: white;
				padding: 2.5rem;
				border-radius: 16px;
				border: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
				transition: all 0.3s;
			}

			.theme-card:hover {
				transform: translateY(-5px);
				box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
				border-color: #197F59;
			}

			.theme-icon {
				font-size: 3rem;
				margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
			}

			.theme-card h3 {
				font-size: 1.5rem;
				font-weight: 600;
				margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
			}

			.theme-subtitle {
				color: #197F59;
				font-weight: 500;
				margin-bottom: 1rem;
			}

			.theme-card p {
				color: #64748b;
				margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
				line-height: 1.6;
			}

			.theme-features {
				display: flex;
				flex-wrap: wrap;
				gap: 0.5rem;
			}

			.feature-tag {
				background: #d1fae5;
				color: #197F59;
				padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
				border-radius: 20px;
				font-size: 0.8rem;
				font-weight: 500;
			}

			/* Prizes Section */
			.prizes-section {
				padding: 6rem 0;
				background: white;
			}

			.prizes-grid {
				display: grid;
				grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
				gap: 2rem;
				max-width: 800px;
				margin: 0 auto;
			}

			.prize-card {
				background: #f8fafc;
				padding: 3rem 2rem;
				border-radius: 16px;
				text-align: center;
				border: 2px solid #e5e5e5;
				transition: all 0.3s;
			}

			.prize-card.winner {
				background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fef3c7, #d1fae5);
				border-color: #197F59;
			}

			.prize-card.runner-up {
				background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ecfdf5, #f0fdf4);
				border-color: #0D402D;
			}

			.prize-badge {
				background: #197F59;
				color: white;
				padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
				border-radius: 50px;
				font-size: 0.9rem;
				font-weight: 600;
				display: inline-block;
				margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
			}

			.prize-card.winner .prize-badge {
				background: #197F59;
			}

			.prize-card.runner-up .prize-badge {
				background: #0D402D;
			}

			.prize-amount {
				font-size: 3rem;
				font-weight: 700;
				color: #197F59;
				margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
			}

			.prize-card.winner .prize-amount {
				color: #197F59;
			}

			.prize-card.runner-up .prize-amount {
				color: #0D402D;
			}

			.prize-title {
				font-size: 1.3rem;
				font-weight: 600;
				margin-bottom: 1rem;
			}

			.prize-card p {
				color: #64748b;
				margin-bottom: 2rem;
			}

			.prize-features {
				text-align: left;
			}

			.prize-feature {
				color: #10b981;
				margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
				font-weight: 500;
			}

			/* Register Section */
			.register-section {
				padding: 6rem 0;
				background: linear-gradient(135deg, #197F59, #0D402D);
				color: white;
				text-align: center;
			}

			.register-content h2 {
				font-size: 2.5rem;
				font-weight: 700;
				margin-bottom: 1rem;
			}

			.register-content p {
				font-size: 1.2rem;
				margin-bottom: 3rem;
				opacity: 0.9;
			}

			.register-form {
				display: flex;
				gap: 1rem;
				justify-content: center;
				margin-bottom: 2rem;
				max-width: 500px;
				margin-left: auto;
				margin-right: auto;
			}

			.email-input {
				flex: 1;
				padding: 1rem;
				border-radius: 8px;
				border: none;
				font-size: 1rem;
			}

			.register-note {
				font-size: 0.9rem;
				opacity: 0.8;
			}

			/* Footer */
			.footer {
				background: #1a1a1a;
				color: white;
				padding: 4rem 0 2rem;
			}

			.footer-content {
				display: grid;
				grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
				gap: 3rem;
				margin-bottom: 3rem;
			}

			.footer-brand img {
				height: 40px;
				margin-bottom: 1rem;
			}

			.footer-brand p {
				color: #a1a1aa;
				line-height: 1.6;
			}

			.footer-links h4,
			.footer-contact h4 {
				font-weight: 600;
				margin-bottom: 1rem;
			}

			.footer-links a {
				display: block;
				color: #a1a1aa;
				text-decoration: none;
				margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
				transition: color 0.2s;
			}

			.footer-links a:hover {
				color: white;
			}

			.footer-contact p {
				color: #a1a1aa;
				margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
			}

			.footer-bottom {
				border-top: 1px solid #374151;
				padding-top: 2rem;
				text-align: center;
				color: #a1a1aa;
			}

			/* Responsive Design */
			@media (max-width: 768px) {
				.nav-links {
					display: none;
				}

				.hero-title {
					font-size: 2.5rem;
				}

				.hero-actions {
					flex-direction: column;
					align-items: center;
				}

				.hero-stats {
					flex-direction: column;
					gap: 2rem;
				}

				.timeline-item {
					flex-direction: column;
					gap: 1rem;
				}

				.timeline-date {
					min-width: auto;
				}

				.themes-grid,
				.prizes-grid {
					grid-template-columns: 1fr;
				}

				.register-form {
					flex-direction: column;
				}

				.footer-content {
					grid-template-columns: 1fr;
					text-align: center;
				}
			}

			/* Smooth scrolling */
			html {
				scroll-behavior: smooth;
			}

			/* Focus styles for accessibility */
			a:focus,
			button:focus {
				outline: 2px solid #197F59;
				outline-offset: 2px;
			}
		</style>
	</body>
</html>
